        "text": "<p><strong>Black Friday & Cyber Monday: [start date] to [end date]. [Offer] with code [CODE]. [Shipping perk.] Ends [day, date and time, Eastern].</strong></p><p>Save on emergency lights, light bars, strobes, sirens, consoles, and Streamlight flashlights from the brands first responders, fleets, and work crews rely on. Use code <strong>[CODE]</strong> at checkout, or <strong>[explain how the discount is applied automatically]</strong>.</p>",
