    "dynamic_rich_text_UV7mBp": {
      "type": "dynamic-rich-text",
      "name": "t:sections.rich_text.presets.rich_text.name",
      "settings": {
        "width": "wide",
        "title": "",
        "text": "<h2>Black Friday and Cyber Monday Deals By Brand</h2><h2>Streamlight Black Friday Deals</h2><p>Flashlights and headlamps are a top pick for holiday gifts and for crews who work in the dark. Shop<a href=\"https://strobesnmore.com/collections/streamlight\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Streamlight deals</span></a>, including the Stinger rechargeable line and tactical lights. <strong>[Offer.]</strong></p><h2>Diode Dynamics Black Friday Sale</h2><p>Light bars and pods from Diode Dynamics are part of this year’s sale. See the<a href=\"https://strobesnmore.com/collections/diode-dynamics\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Diode Dynamics collection</span></a> for <strong>[offer]</strong>.</p><h2>Strobes N’ More Brand Deals</h2><p>Our own line of LED strobes, light bars, and beacons is built for working vehicles. Browse<a href=\"https://strobesnmore.com/collections/strobes-n-more\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Strobes N’ More products</span></a> with <strong>[offer]</strong>.&nbsp;</p><h2>Whelen, Federal Signal, Feniex, SoundOff Signal and TowMate</h2><p>Shop<a href=\"https://strobesnmore.com/collections/whelen-products\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Whelen</span></a>,<a href=\"https://strobesnmore.com/collections/federal-signal\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Federal Signal</span></a>,<a href=\"https://strobesnmore.com/collections/feniex\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Feniex</span></a>,<a href=\"https://strobesnmore.com/collections/soundoff-signal\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">SoundOff Signal</span></a> and<a href=\"https://strobesnmore.com/collections/towmate\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">TowMate</span></a> for <strong>[offer, or “our regular pricing on pro-grade gear”]</strong>.</p><h2>Shop Black Friday Deals by Category</h2><ul><li><a href=\"https://strobesnmore.com/collections/lightbars\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Light bars</strong></span></a><strong>:</strong><a href=\"https://strobesnmore.com/collections/mini-lightbars\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">mini</span></a> and<a href=\"https://strobesnmore.com/collections/full-size-lightbars\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">full-size</span></a> bars for trucks, tow trucks and patrol vehicles</li><li><a href=\"https://strobesnmore.com/collections/hide-away-leds\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Strobes and hide-away LEDs</strong></span></a><strong>:</strong> surface mounts, grille lights and beacons</li><li><a href=\"https://strobesnmore.com/collections/sirens-speakers\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Sirens and speakers</strong></span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://strobesnmore.com/collections/vehicle-specific-consoles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Vehicle consoles</strong></span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://strobesnmore.com/collections/snow-plow-winter-lights\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Snow plow and winter lights</strong></span></a><strong>:</strong> upgrade before the first big storm</li><li><a href=\"https://strobesnmore.com/collections/flood-scene-spotlights\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Flood and scene lights</strong></span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://strobesnmore.com/collections/flashlights\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Flashlights</strong></span></a></li></ul><p>New products and last-chance pieces are in<a href=\"https://strobesnmore.com/collections/new-products\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">New Products</span></a> and the<a href=\"https://strobesnmore.com/collections/garage-sale\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Garage Sale</span></a>.</p><h2>Why Shop Strobes N’ More This Black Friday</h2><ul><li><strong>Emergency and work-vehicle lighting only.</strong> We don’t sell generic car accessories. Every product page lists real specs and reviews.</li><li><strong>Help choosing.</strong> Call us, use the chat icon, or email sales@strobesnmore.com. We’ll help match lights to your vehicle.</li><li><strong>Installation and support.</strong> See our<a href=\"https://strobesnmore.com/pages/installation-service\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">installation service</span></a>, install guides and videos, and<a href=\"https://strobesnmore.com/pages/warranty-and-repairs\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">warranty and repairs</span></a>.</li><li><strong>Fleet and dealer pricing.</strong> Outfitting more than a few vehicles? Visit our<a href=\"https://strobesnmore.com/pages/dealers\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Dealer Program</span></a>. <strong>[Say whether sale pricing combines with dealer pricing.]</strong></li><li><strong>Rewards.</strong> <strong>[Say whether reward points can be used or earned during the sale.]</strong></li></ul>",
        "heading_size": "medium",
        "text_alignment": "left"
      }
    },
